{
  "description": "The creature is a large quadrupedal mammal shown in right-facing profile on a plain light background. Its body, neck, head and limbs are covered in dense, shaggy fur that is dark brown on the back, sides, outer legs and top of the head, and lighter creamy-tan on the muzzle, lower cheek, chest and belly. The head is bear-like with a blunt snout, small dark eyes, and two small rounded ears on top. A single smooth, black, upward-curving horn projects from the tip of the snout. The entire dorsal surface from just behind the neck to over the hindquarters is covered by a large, highly glossy, dark reddish-brown domed shell with a reflective surface and faint horizontal ridging. The animal stands on four thick, fur-covered legs ending in broad paws with visible claws. No wings, gills, tentacles, or distinct tail are visible; the rear is obscured by fur and the overhanging edge of the shell.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "bear-like, broad with a blunt elongated snout, covered in brown fur with a lighter tan muzzle and lower cheek, small dark brown eyes on the side of the face, mouth closed",
      "where": "at the front of the body, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "horns",
      "looks_like": "single smooth black horn, curved upward and tapering to a sharp point, with a glossy surface",
      "where": "protruding from the tip of the snout on the nose"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small, rounded, densely furred ears, dark brown",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly behind the other in profile view"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, muscular, shaggy-furred legs, dark brown with lighter fur on the inner and lower belly area",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and shoulder, two hindlegs under the rump, supporting the body in a standing posture"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad paws with blunt toes and prominent light tan to dark curved claws protruding from the fur; front paws show 5+ visible claws",
      "where": "at the ends of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "shell",
      "looks_like": "large, domed, highly glossy dark reddish-brown structure with a smooth reflective surface and subtle horizontal ridges on the main dome",
      "where": "covering the entire back from behind the neck to above the hind legs, sitting on top of the fur"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "shell divided into a smaller smooth convex shoulder plate behind the neck and a larger elongated ridged main plate over the back and sides, with a fringe of small rectangular brown scutes along the lower side and rear edge",
      "where": "forming the shell on the dorsal and lateral back"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
